  "ai::zh::Add ingredients seen in scans but not on your receipt inventory. Calendar and unified pantry live on the Freshness tab.": "添加扫描中看到的成分，但收据库存中没有的成分。日历和统一食品储藏室位于“新鲜度”选项卡上。",
